{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":55,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["To the chief Musician on Neginoth, Maschil, A ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Psalm"]}," of David. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 55:1"},"Give ear to my prayer, O God; and hide not thyself from my supplication. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 55:2"},"Attend unto me, and hear me: I mourn in my complaint, and make a noise; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 55:3"},"Because of the voice of the enemy, because of the oppression of the wicked: for they cast iniquity upon me, and in wrath they hate me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 55:4"},"My heart is sore pained within me: and the terrors of death are fallen upon me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 55:5"},"Fearfulness and trembling are come upon me, and horror hath overwhelmed me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 55:6"},"And I said, Oh that I had wings like a dove! ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for then"]}," would I fly away, and be at rest. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 55:7"},"Lo, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["then"]}," would I wander far off, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," remain in the wilderness. Selah. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 55:8"},"I would hasten my escape from the windy storm ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," tempest. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 55:9"},"Destroy, O Lord, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," divide their tongues: for I have seen violence and strife in the city. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 55:10"},"Day and night they go about it upon the walls thereof: mischief also and sorrow ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," in the midst of it. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 55:11"},"Wickedness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," in the midst thereof: deceit and guile depart not from her streets. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 55:12"},"For ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it was"]}," not an enemy ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," reproached me; then I could have borne ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it:"]}," neither ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was it"]}," he that hated me ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," did magnify ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["himself"]}," against me; then I would have hid myself from him: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 55:13"},"But ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it was"]}," thou, a man mine equal, my guide, and mine acquaintance. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 55:14"},"We took sweet counsel together, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," walked unto the house of God in company. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 55:15"},"Let death seize upon them, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," let them go down quick into hell: for wickedness is in their dwellings, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," among them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:15"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PSA 55:16"},"As for me, I will call upon God; and the LORD shall save me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:16"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PSA 55:17"},"Evening, and morning, and at noon, will I pray, and cry aloud: and he shall hear my voice. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:17"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PSA 55:18"},"He hath delivered my soul in peace from the battle ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that was "]},"against me: for there were many with me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:18"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PSA 55:19"},"God shall hear, and afflict them, even he that abideth of old. Selah. Because they have no changes, therefore they fear not God. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:19"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PSA 55:20"},"He hath put forth his hands against such as be at peace with him: he hath broken his covenant. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:20"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PSA 55:21"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["The words"]}," of his mouth were smoother than butter, but war ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was"]}," in his heart: his words were softer than oil, yet ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["were "]},"they drawn swords. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:21"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PSA 55:22"},"Cast thy burden upon the LORD, and he shall sustain thee: he shall never suffer the righteous to be moved. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:22"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PSA 55:23"},"But thou, O God, shalt bring them down into the pit of destruction: bloody and deceitful men shall not live out half their days; but I will trust in thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 55:23"}]}]}
